engine/evals/fixtures/terminal_session.txt -text

# These three sources hold a raw NUL byte on purpose: a composite map key, a
# replacement sentinel, and a rejected-input test case. Git calls any file with
# a NUL binary, which costs them line-by-line diffs in review (the EOL detector
# looks for a NUL anywhere, the diff detector only in the first ~8000 bytes, so
# two of the three render as `Bin` and one does not). `diff` forces text diff
# back on. They are already LF; nothing here converts anything.
packages/shared/contracts/scripts/validate-continuous-improvement.mjs diff
src/mcp-servers/caveman-shrink/compress.js diff
tests/hooks/caveman-config.test.mjs diff
